  "notes": "USAGE:\nUsed in both everyday and specialized contexts. In daily life, most commonly heard as {水分|すいぶん}{補給|ほきゅう} (hydration) and {栄養|えいよう}{補給|ほきゅう} (nutrition replenishment). In military and logistics contexts, refers to supply lines and provisioning.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {水分|すいぶん}{補給|ほきゅう}: hydration, fluid replenishment\n- {栄養|えいよう}{補給|ほきゅう}: nutrition replenishment\n- {補給|ほきゅう}{路|ろ}: supply route/line\n- {補給|ほきゅう}{基地|きち}: supply base\n- {補給|ほきゅう}{物資|ぶっし}: supplies, provisions",
